Location in this repository
---------------------------

The vendored files are under ZInQKernel/Contrib/TauCeti/ (Lean module prefix
ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.). A Tau Ceti module TauCeti.A.B is vendored as
ZInQKernel/Contrib/TauCeti/A/B.lean. Every vendored file keeps Tau Ceti's copyright
header and carries, directly after it, a provenance line

  -- Vendored from Tau Ceti (https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti, commit <sha>, module <module>), Apache-2.0.

naming the source commit and module. Declaration names and namespaces are unchanged.
The mechanical changes made to every vendored file are this provenance line and the
rewriting of each `import TauCeti.X` to `import ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.X`.
Files under Backport/ (task kw-new) hold declarations taken from the commit-97a5b235
version of a Tau Ceti module whose commit-5a01f5fe version is vendored; they keep
Tau Ceti's copyright header and carry a line "-- Backported from Tau Ceti (...)"
naming the source commit and module.

